000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CVALFRT.
000400 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        NOVEMBER 1986.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM PERFORMS FREIGHT VALIDATION CHECKS
001000*           THAT ARE COMMON TO BOTH THE FREIGHT CREATE AND FREIGHT
001100*           CORRECTION PROGRAMS.
      *C
      *C 09/23/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON THE THE DATE VERIFICATION.
      *C
001200
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001900 01  PLANT-VALUE                   PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
002000 01  DETERMINE-PLANT REDEFINES PLANT-VALUE.
002100     05  PLANT-NUM                 PIC X.
002200         88  KELLY-PLANT                     VALUE "2".
002300     05  FILLER                    PIC X(2).
002400
002500*----------  PAST AND FUTURE PRO DATE CHECKS
       01  CHK1-DATE-CN.
           05  CHK1-DATE-CC              PIC X(2).
           05  CHK1-DATE.
               10  CHK1-DATE-YY          PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(4).
       01  CHECK1-DATE  REDEFINES CHK1-DATE-CN PIC 9(8).
       01  CHK2-DATE-CN.
           05  CHK2-DATE-CC              PIC X(2).
           05  CHK2-DATE.
               10  CHK2-DATE-YY          PIC X(2).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(4).
       01  CHECK2-DATE REDEFINES CHK2-DATE-CN  PIC 9(8).
003000
003100 COPY TDATECHK OF COPYLIB.
003200**************************************************************
003300**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
003400**************************************************************
003500 LINKAGE SECTION.
003600 01  CVF-PLANT                     PIC X(3).
003700 01  CVF-MESSAGE-BUFFER.
003800     05  MSG-BUFFER                PIC X(68).
003900     05  MSG-VALUE                 PIC X(4).
004000 01  FIELD-NUMBER                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
004100 01  KELLY-PO-TYPE                 PIC X.
       COPY FRTDOCK OF COPYLIB.
006800 COPY LANGSUB OF COPYLIB.
006900 01  CVF-FILLER                    PIC X(10).
007000
007100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CVF-PLANT, CVF-MESSAGE-BUFFER,
007200                          FIELD-NUMBER,
007300                          KELLY-PO-TYPE, FREIGHT-SCREEN-BUFFER,
007400                          LANGUAGE-PARMS, CVF-FILLER.
007500 00-CVALFRT-MAIN.
007600
007700     MOVE CVF-PLANT             TO PLANT-VALUE.
007800     MOVE ZEROES                TO LANG-MSGNUM, LANG-SETNUM.
007900     MOVE SPACES                TO CVF-MESSAGE-BUFFER.
008000     PERFORM 600-VALIDATE-FREIGHT THRU 699-EXIT.
008100
008200     IF KELLY-PLANT
008300        PERFORM 700-KELLY-ONLY THRU 799-EXIT.
008400
008500     GOBACK.
008600
008700 600-VALIDATE-FREIGHT.
008800*************************************************************
008900*            THE FREIGHT PRO DATE MUST BE IN VALID          *
009000*            FORMAT, CANNOT BE A FUTURE DATE, AND           *
009100*            CANNOT BE MORE THAN ONE YEAR AGO.              *
009200*************************************************************
009300*----------  CHECK FOR VALID FREIGHT DATE
009400     IF FREIGHT-DATE-BUF = SPACES
009500        GO TO 650-MORE-CHECKS.
009600     MOVE 1                TO DATE-MODE.
009700     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
009800     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT     TO CHK1-DATE.
           IF CHK1-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO CHK1-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO CHK1-DATE-CC.
009900     MOVE FREIGHT-DATE-BUF TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
010000     MOVE 3                TO DATE-MODE.
010100     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
010200     IF DATE-RET-CODE NOT = ZERO
010300        MOVE DATE-MSG      TO CVF-MESSAGE-BUFFER
010400        MOVE 21            TO FIELD-NUMBER
010500        GO TO 699-EXIT.
010600     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT     TO CHK2-DATE.
           IF CHK2-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO CHK2-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO CHK2-DATE-CC.
010700
010800*----------  CANNOT BE A FUTURE DATE
010900     IF CHECK2-DATE > CHECK1-DATE
011000*       ***  CANNOT BE A FUTURE DATE  ***
011100        MOVE   3           TO LANG-SETNUM
011200        MOVE  40           TO LANG-MSGNUM
011300        MOVE  21           TO FIELD-NUMBER
011400        GO TO 699-EXIT.
011500
011600*----------  CANNOT BE OLDER THAN LAST YEAR
011700     SUBTRACT 10000 FROM CHECK1-DATE.
011800     IF CHECK2-DATE < CHECK1-DATE
011900*       ***  DATE CANNOT BE OLDER THAN ONE YEAR  ***
012000        MOVE   4           TO LANG-SETNUM
012100        MOVE  19           TO LANG-MSGNUM
012200        MOVE  21           TO FIELD-NUMBER
012300        GO TO 699-EXIT.
012400
       650-MORE-CHECKS.
012500*----------  DISPLAY WARNING IF CHARGES > 100,000
012600     IF FREIGHT-CHARGES-BUF9 > 100000
012700        MOVE  6            TO FIELD-NUMBER
012800        MOVE  6            TO LANG-SETNUM
012900        MOVE 13            TO LANG-MSGNUM
013000        GO TO 699-EXIT.
013100
      *----------  TYPE OF FREIGHT MUST BE ENTERED
PDR   *    IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = "G" OR "P" OR "C" OR "U" OR "D"
PDR        IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = "P" OR "C" OR "U" OR "D"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              MOVE 1             TO FIELD-NUMBER
              MOVE 66            TO LANG-SETNUM
              MOVE 086           TO LANG-MSGNUM
              GO TO 699-EXIT.

      *----------  EMPLOYEES INITIALS MUST BE ENTERED
           IF EMPLOYEE-BUF = SPACES
              MOVE 2             TO FIELD-NUMBER
              MOVE 66            TO LANG-SETNUM
              MOVE 087           TO LANG-MSGNUM
              GO TO 699-EXIT.

      *----------  IF COLLECT, CARRIER MUST BE ENTERED
           IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = "C"
              IF CARRIER-BUF = SPACES
                 MOVE 4          TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 MOVE 66         TO LANG-SETNUM
                 MOVE 088        TO LANG-MSGNUM
                 GO TO 699-EXIT.

           IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = "U"
              MOVE "UPSX" TO CARRIER-BUF.
           IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = "D"
              MOVE "DELY" TO CARRIER-BUF.

      *----------  DATE MUST BE ENTERED WITH FREIGHT BILL
           IF FREIGHT-NO-BUF NOT = SPACES
              IF FREIGHT-DATE-BUF = SPACES
                 MOVE 21         TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 MOVE 66         TO LANG-SETNUM
                 MOVE 090        TO LANG-MSGNUM
                 GO TO 699-EXIT.

      *----------  CARRIERS WEIGHT MUST BE ENTERED WITH FREIGHT BILL
           IF FREIGHT-NO-BUF NOT = SPACES
              IF CARR-WT-BUF = ZEROES
                 MOVE 12         TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 MOVE 66         TO LANG-SETNUM
                 MOVE 91         TO LANG-MSGNUM
                 GO TO 699-EXIT.

      *---------  CARRIERS WEIGHT CANNOT BE GREATER THAN 999,999
           IF CARR-WT-BUF > 999999
              MOVE 12            TO FIELD-NUMBER
              MOVE 66            TO LANG-SETNUM
              MOVE 92            TO LANG-MSGNUM
              GO TO 699-EXIT.

      *---------  OUT WEIGHT CANNOT BE GREATER THAN 999,999
           IF OUR-WT-BUF > 999999
              MOVE 12            TO FIELD-NUMBER
              MOVE 66            TO LANG-SETNUM
              MOVE 92            TO LANG-MSGNUM
              GO TO 699-EXIT.
013200 699-EXIT.  EXIT.
013300*************************************************************
013400*    KELLY CHECKS:  CARRIER ID IS REQUIRED.  IF A RAW       *
013500*    MATERIAL, OUR WEIGHT OR CARRIER'S WEIGHT IS REQUIRED.  *
013600*************************************************************
013700 700-KELLY-ONLY.
013800     IF CARRIER-BUF = SPACES
013900*       *** CARRIER ID IS REQUIRED ***
014000        MOVE   3           TO LANG-SETNUM
014100        MOVE 143           TO LANG-MSGNUM
014200        MOVE 4             TO FIELD-NUMBER
014300        GO TO 799-EXIT.
014400
014500     IF KELLY-PO-TYPE = "2"
            IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF NOT = "U"
      * IF CARRIER NOT UPS...
014700* CARRIER'S WEIGHT OR OUR WEIGHT MUST BE ENTERED FOR RAW MATERIALS *
014600        IF CARR-WT-BUF = ZEROES AND OUR-WT-BUF = ZEROES
014800           MOVE   3        TO LANG-SETNUM
014900           MOVE  99        TO LANG-MSGNUM
015000           MOVE  12        TO FIELD-NUMBER
015100           GO TO 799-EXIT.
015200 799-EXIT.  EXIT.
